author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-22 15:41:21 -0600
subject: fix(iflow): add AbortSignal.timeout(15s) to cookie validation fetches (GAP-P2-21)

iFlow platform.iflow.cn API may be slow/unreachable from some networks,
causing the settings page to hang indefinitely during cookie validation.

- Add signal: AbortSignal.timeout(15000) to both GET and POST fetch calls
- Catch TimeoutError/AbortError and return 504 with user-friendly message
- Add 7-test regression suite covering both fetch paths, both error names,
  non-timeout passthrough (500), and anti-false-positive source check

